#: ../../docs/media/video-library.md:3 17831365ab9a481692ac3c8aa6eadbd6
msgid ""
"Short and long-form videos are indexed together. Historical entries are "
"preserved even when they leave the YouTube feed window; a missing pair or "
"transcript remains visible instead of being invented."
msgstr ""
"Los videos cortos y largos se indexan juntos. Las entradas historicas se "
"conservan aunque salgan de la ventana del feed de YouTube; una pareja o "
"transcripcion ausente permanece visible en lugar de inventarse."

